            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci gujolo tamme, ka gilwoŋo lukwena gudwogo, ci gugoyogi kun gicikogi ni pe gulok i nyiŋ Yecu, ka doŋ giwekogi gucito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gua woko ki i nyim Lukiko ma onoŋo cwinygi yom pien Lubaŋa otamo ni gimyero pi dit man me noŋo lewic pi nyiŋ Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok nino ducu pe guweko pwonyo dano ki tito lok me kwena maber ni Yecu en aye Kricito ma Lubaŋa oyero i ot pa Lubaŋa ki i paco pa dano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.42"
            ]
          }
        }
